          "props": {
            "text": "I'm Marcus Hale, a four-time founder. The first three were 18-month bonfires. Linkpath is the fourth — built on every painful lesson from the others, shipped in public, and on track to its first $1M ARR. This is the long version of how that happened, and what I wish someone had told me at startup #1."
